 "body": {
  "summary": "The second day of bright Kartika, when Yama ate at Yamuna's house.",
  "why": [
   {
    "text": "On Kartika Shukla Dvitiya Yama was fed by Yamuna in his own house.",
    "basis": "text",
    "text_name": "Bhavishya Purana, Uttara-parva",
    "ref": "Bhavishya 4.14",
    "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=32093&prop=wikitext&format=json"
   },
   {
    "text": "The day is therefore called Yama Dvitiya in the world.",
    "basis": "text",
    "text_name": "Bhavishya Purana, Uttara-parva",
    "ref": "Bhavishya 4.14",
    "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=32093&prop=wikitext&format=json"
   },
   {
    "text": "On this day the wise do not eat at home.",
    "basis": "text",
    "text_name": "Bhavishya Purana, Uttara-parva",
    "ref": "Bhavishya 4.14",
    "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=32093&prop=wikitext&format=json"
   },
   {
    "text": "One eats from a sister's hand out of love, which nourishes and strengthens.",
    "basis": "text",
    "text_name": "Bhavishya Purana, Uttara-parva",
    "ref": "Bhavishya 4.14",
    "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=32093&prop=wikitext&format=json"
   },
   {
    "text": "Sisters are honoured with gifts of gold, ornaments, clothes, worship, and food.",
    "basis": "text",
    "text_name": "Bhavishya Purana, Uttara-parva",
    "ref": "Bhavishya 4.14",
    "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=32093&prop=wikitext&format=json"
   }
  ],
  "do": {
   "gather": [
    {
     "text": "Keep gifts of clothes and ornaments ready for sisters.",
     "basis": "text",
     "text_name": "Bhavishya Purana, Uttara-parva",
     "ref": "Bhavishya 4.14",
     "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=32093&prop=wikitext&format=json"
    }
   ],
   "steps": [
    {
     "text": "Eat the meal from your sister's hand.",
     "basis": "text",
     "text_name": "Bhavishya Purana, Uttara-parva",
     "ref": "Bhavishya 4.14",
     "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=32093&prop=wikitext&format=json"
    },
    {
     "text": "Honour every sister with gifts, worship, and food.",
     "basis": "text",
     "text_name": "Bhavishya Purana, Uttara-parva",
     "ref": "Bhavishya 4.14",
     "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=32093&prop=wikitext&format=json"
    }
   ]
  },
